      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$$\\begin{array}{r}\nax^2 + amx + am^2 + b \\\\\nx - m \\enclose{longdiv}{ax^3 + bx + c} \\\\\n<u>ax^3 - amx^2</u> \\\\\namx^2 + bx + c \\\\\n<u>amx^2 - am^2x</u> \\\\\n(am^2 + b)x + c \\\\\n<u>(am^2 + b)x - (am^2 + b)m</u> \\\\\nam^3 + bm + c\n\\end{array}$$",
