    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.8-p023",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**সমাধান:** $P(x)$ কে $x - a$ দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ হবে $P(a) = a^3 + 5a^2 + 6a + 8$,\nএবং $P(x)$ কে $x - b$ দ্বারা ভাগ করলে ভাগশেষ হবে $P(b) = b^3 + 5b^2 + 6b + 8$।\nশর্তানুসারে, $a^3 + 5a^2 + 6a + 8 = b^3 + 5b^2 + 6b + 8$\nবা, $a^3 - b^3 + 5(a^2 - b^2) + 6(a - b) = 0$\nবা, $(a - b)(a^2 + b^2 + ab + 5a + 5b + 6) = 0$\n$\\therefore a^2 + b^2 + ab + 5a + 5b + 6 = 0$, যেহেতু $a \\neq b$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "P(x)",
        "x - a",
        "P(a) = a^3 + 5a^2 + 6a + 8",
        "P(x)",
        "x - b",
        "P(b) = b^3 + 5b^2 + 6b + 8",
        "a^3 + 5a^2 + 6a + 8 = b^3 + 5b^2 + 6b + 8",
        "a^3 - b^3 + 5(a^2 - b^2) + 6(a - b) = 0",
        "(a - b)(a^2 + b^2 + ab + 5a + 5b + 6) = 0",
        "\\therefore a^2 + b^2 + ab + 5a + 5b + 6 = 0",
        "a \\neq b"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 49,
      "pdfPageEnd": 49,
      "printedPageStart": 44,
      "printedPageEnd": 44,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
